{{Quote|The Mandalorian's heavy firepower won't be enough to repel our droid ships.''"<br />"''Good. Press the attack. Deploy our infantry&mdash;every last soldier.|[[Tey-Zuka]] and [[General]] [[Grievous]], discussing their C-9979 landing crafts during the [[Battle of Zanbar]]|<ref name="Darth Maul&mdash;Son of Dathomir 1">[[Darth Maul — Son of Dathomir 1|''Darth Maul — Son of Dathomir'' 1]]</ref>}}
A '''landing craft''' was a type of [[starship]] that served as a [[transport]] for armed forces between a [[capital ship]] and a [[planet]]ary surface.<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref> Examples included the [[Trade Federation]]'s [[C-9979 landing craft]]<ref name="Episode I">{{Film|I}}</ref> and the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Sentinel-class landing craft|''Sentinel''-class landing craft]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|imperial-sentinel-class-shuttle|Imperial ''Sentinel''-Class Shuttle}}</ref>

